message: "If you use Sensor2Spike in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Sensor2Spike"
abstract: >-
  A local-first Python toolkit for turning multichannel sensor recordings into
  spike trains and measuring which encoder configuration is worth running on a
  spiking neural network.
